  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Cut spinach falafels into quarters. Roughly chop tomato. Grate carrot.\n• In a bowl, combine Greek-style yoghurt, red pesto and a drizzle of olive oil. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/624e39993f4dda0bbf16c862/step-217ba066.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat and add olive oil (1/4 cup for 2 people / 1/2 cup for 4 people).\n• When oil is hot, cook falafel, tossing, until deep golden brown, 5-6 mins. Transfer to plate lined with paper towel.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/624e39993f4dda0bbf16c862/step-b7d2159a.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, in a medium bowl, combine a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season with salt and pepper.\n• Add mixed leaves, tomato and carrot and toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/624e39993f4dda0bbf16c862/step-c26e8916.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Microwave mini flour tortillas on a plate for 10 seconds bursts until warmed through.\n• Build tacos by filling tortillas with salad and fafafels.\n• Drizzle over pesto-yoghurt. Sprinkle over flaked almonds.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/624e39993f4dda0bbf16c862/step-035fed10.jpg"
    }
  ]
